OL,3,GNEWSA'Brave' bakery worker helped man
OL,4,Aescape flat fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "brave" bakery employee has been
OL,7,Fpraised for helping a man escape from a
OL,8,Ffire that broke out above the store
OL,9,Fwhile she was on shift.
OL,11,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service was
OL,12,Fcalled to the flat fire above Birds
OL,13,FBakery in Town Street, Duffield, at
OL,14,F14:58 BST on Saturday.
OL,16,FLilith Jackson, from Derby, said she
OL,17,Fwas made aware smoke was coming from
OL,18,Fthe flat above the bakery during her
OL,19,Fshift and went to alert the tenant, who
OL,20,Fwas asleep inside, before going
OL,21,Fupstairs to ensure he evacuated safely.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
