OL,3,GNEWSA'Brave' bakery worker helped man
OL,4,Aescape flat fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FJackson said: "I've been overwhelmed by
OL,7,Fthe response since and incredibly
OL,8,Fgrateful for how supportive everyone
OL,9,Fhas been. I'm just really happy that
OL,10,Fhe's OK."
